  "19": {
    "id": "19",
    "title": "SHAPHAR 2025进博会｜展台设计搭建",
    "titleEn": "SHAPHAR CIIE 2025｜Booth Design and Construction",
    "client": "SHAPHAR",
    "year": "2026/03/17",
    "tags": [
      "展会设计",
      "空间设计",
      "进博会"
    ],
    "cover": "/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/cases/case-6.webp",
    "content": "<p>当数智化浪潮席卷全球医药健康产业，SHAPHAR于2025年稳步迈入AI元年。</p><p>作为八届进博“全勤生”，CHOICE历时5个多月，为SHAPHAR策划+搭建一站式进博展台。</p><p>我们结合SHAPHAR品牌战略，拟定了“智融新生，与AI共跃进”的主题概念。我们从创意锚点到落地呈现，从互动装置到场景叙事，为其进博舞台带来全方位的升级。</p><p>特大双层展台规划，将展示空间放大，巨幕舞台，彰显医药服务引领者的磅礴气势。</p><p>我们通过前沿科技与艺术美学的交融，让SHAPHAR从众多展台中脱颖而出，例如“黑科技”波浪屏、机械接待台、报纸打卡机、智能智眼人数统计等，吸引众多观众驻足、体验。</p><p>我们为SHAPHAR定制了AI进博之歌，也用更创意、新潮、智慧的开馆仪式，为SHAPHAR树立起“数智+医药”的行业先锋形象。</p><p>展会设计，本就是一种「实用的艺术」，从理念到功能到视觉，展台的每一个亮点，都是我们巧思的呈现。</p><p><strong>参与展会：2025中国国际进口博览会</strong></p><p><strong>展台面积：约800平方米</strong></p><p><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/01.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/02.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/03.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/04.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/05.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/06.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/07.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/08.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/09.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/10.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/11.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/12.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void>\n<video poster=\"\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\"><source src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/video-1.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void>\n<video poster=\"\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\"><source src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/video-2.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/13.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/14.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/15.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/16.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/17.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/18.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/19.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/20.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/21.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/22.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/23.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/24.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/25.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/26.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/27.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/28.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/29.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/30.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/31.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/19/32.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>"
