  "21": {
    "id": "21",
    "title": "2025 CHOICE｜我们的年度闪光记忆",
    "titleEn": "2025 CHOICE｜Our Annual Glorious Memories",
    "client": "CHOICE",
    "year": "2026/03/18",
    "tags": [
      "年度总结",
      "案例"
    ],
    "cover": "/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/cases/case-5.webp",
    "content": "<p>站在2026开篇，回顾2025闪光的一年。</p><p>这一年，我们深耕创意赛道，打磨有温度的品牌IP，全年锁定100+项目机会，交付近百份创意方案、50+优质项目，深度联动政府、世界TOP品牌及高端地产，实现创意价值落地。</p><p>从视觉创意、品牌营销单点服务，到「专注品牌全维度解决方案」的复合型综合服务商，CHOICE的成长，凝聚着一群人的同心深耕与光芒绽放。</p><p>未来的CHOICE，将保持初心并勇往直前～<br><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/01.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void>\n<video poster=\"\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\"><source src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/video-1.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/02.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/03.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/04.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/05.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/06.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/07.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/08.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/09.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/10.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/11.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/12.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/13.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/14.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/15.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/21/16.webp\" alt=