  "22": {
    "id": "22",
    "title": "2026金山乡村艺术季活动全案",
    "titleEn": "JINSHAN  ART SEASON",
    "client": "金山枫泾",
    "year": "2026年7月14日",
    "tags": [
      "市集",
      "展陈",
      "展览设计",
      "艺术节"
    ],
    "cover": "/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/cases/case-4.png",
    "content": "<p>2026年4月25日，“沪派江南 艺美金山——2026 金山乡村艺术季暨中国农民画村开放20周年主题活动”于中国农民画村盛大启幕。</p><p>CHOICE全程深度助力，统筹承担创意策划、空间搭建、场景落地及现场执行全链路配套服务，深植于枫泾的文化沃土，以金山农民画非遗文化与乡野自然肌理为创作内核，打破艺术边界，让艺术走出展馆、浸润乡野，匠心打造沉浸式乡村艺术盛会。</p><p><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/01.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/02.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/03.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/04.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/05.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/06.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/07.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/08.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/09.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/10.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/11.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/12.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/13.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/14.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/15.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/22/16.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>"
