  "24": {
    "id": "24",
    "title": "礼来父亲节科普行动：别让鼾声成为健康的休止符",
    "titleEn": "Lilly Science Popularization Action",
    "client": "礼来",
    "year": "2026",
    "tags": [
      "品牌活动",
      "延展设计"
    ],
    "cover": "/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/cases/case-2.png",
    "content": "<p>2026年6月礼来一系列阻塞性睡眠呼吸暂停（OSA）行动正式开启，由CHOICE提供全案落地服务。项目以礼来OSA“小红人”IP为原型，进行视觉创意演绎，落地上海静安寺地铁站3D枕头艺术装置，同步举办沉浸式调研报告发布会，直观科普打鼾潜藏的健康风险，倡导OSA早筛早治。</p><p>线下地铁曝光超140 万人次，线上全平台传播70万+，获人民网、南方周末等权威媒体集中报道，兼顾大众健康科普与品牌声量提升，以沉浸式创意让医学科普更易感知。<br><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/01.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/02.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/03.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/04.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/05.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/06.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/07.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/08.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/09.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/10.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/11.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/12.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/13.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/14.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/15.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/16.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/17.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"/api/uploads/sites/choicedesign/works/24/18.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/><img src=\"